Sam works with people who know something in their life needs sustained
attention, not a burst of motivation. The approach is practice-first:
showing up on a schedule small enough to actually keep, treating an off
day as information rather than a verdict, and building the kind of
accountability that outlasts an initial burst of enthusiasm.

Based in Portland, OR.
